						 <p>I mean, to be fair…</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>Description:</strong> SCP-192 is a vacuum x-ray tube that forms the primary component of a diagnostic x-ray machine manufactured by ███████ on ██-██-20██, with diagnostic use commencing on █-██-20██. This machine was designated SCP-192-1.</p> </blockquote> 
