				<wikidot:authorName>SifSeeker</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>3770796</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Overall, I really liked the post. It is an interesting concept, and has a good mix of risk and reward.</p> <p>It took me until the end of the article to put together that the initial image didn't correspond to the actual state of the subject. If I'm putting it together correctly, SCP-192 creates an image of a subject that is in a somewhat random state?</p> <p>Just a little clarification would make this SCP amazing</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
