					<![CDATA[
						 <p>FYI, alpha and beta radiation aren't that dangerous. <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beta_particle">Alpha particles bounce off paper; beta won't penetrate aluminum.</a> A hazmat suit would let personnel handle this thing quite safely (well, as long as they're not the ones being X-rayed).</p> 
